feat 1.0

# ADR-0034: an object inside a list is exact, so a field it does not name is already required absent; `absent` is a second spelling, refused as MALFORMED_SYNTAX with a hint to leave the field out (ruling 7ca2385c).

spec SPEC-BAD-130 "Absent on a field of an object inside a list"
context Bad
aggregate Thing
type command
status draft

construct:
  handler at src/do-thing.ts
  touches src/**

enforce:
  do the thing

contract:
  input ThingInput
  response ThingResult
  record ThingRow

scenario "does the thing":
  when: DoThing { value: 1 }
  predict success:
    response OK ThingResult
    eventStore has [ Wrote with ThingRow { members: [ { name: "a", text: any string, size: absent } ] } ]
